Scoped MIDI Sample Dump Standard demuxer

The header fields, probe, sample-period rate, packet framing and the
byte2_read, byte3_read and byte4_read unpacking in src/sds.ts follow
libavformat/sdsdec.c (sds_probe, sds_read_header, sds_read_packet).
